          "body": "The depth check looks fine to me. The `NOLINTNEXTLINE` suppression should be just above the line containing the function name. Descriptions of the various suppression options can be found at https://clang.llvm.org/extra/clang-tidy/#suppressing-undesired-diagnostics",
